{"3921560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "COMANOMALY", "steam_appid": 3921560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMANOMALY </strong>is a mix between whodunnit mystery and horror game, with different randomly selected culprit each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The title is a portmanteau of <strong>Coma<i> </i></strong><i>(state of deep unconsciousness)</i> and <strong>Anomaly </strong><i>(abnormalities)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our demo is frequently updated, so check often, or click the <strong>follow</strong> / <strong>wishlist</strong> button above to be informed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1771768859\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/8a17f4ab7a6012c8f8ced2bd83b5162b.poster.avif?t=1771768859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/8a17f4ab7a6012c8f8ced2bd83b5162b.webm?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/8a17f4ab7a6012c8f8ced2bd83b5162b.mp4?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1771768859\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/ac903af571d21d6127502ce5b32a1696.avif?t=1771768859\" width=630 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It's 1985. You are <strong>Susi</strong>, a nurse working for <strong>Sudaritra Hospital</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One night, a very wealthy and powerful patient was admitted to the hospital with weird symptoms and peculiar conditions: <strong>Reynald Suroso</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧑‍⚕️ A family doctor.<br>🔮 A family &quot;spiritual guide&quot;.<br>🗡️ A backstabbing family member, trying to kill the patient.<br><br>What could possibly go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️‍♀️ Play COMANOMALY, and your tasks will be :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Examine the <strong>anomalies</strong> left by mystical creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find <strong>notes</strong> left by the doctor and the shaman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Check the <strong>life support machine</strong> and mark abnormal medical symptoms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pay attention to <strong>dialogues</strong>, <strong>characters</strong>, and the <strong>environment</strong> to uncover the culprit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Try to get the <strong>best possible completion time</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1771768859\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/50f0ddbca6dc7d03b00686e6d23ea5ef.poster.avif?t=1771768859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/50f0ddbca6dc7d03b00686e6d23ea5ef.webm?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/50f0ddbca6dc7d03b00686e6d23ea5ef.mp4?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1771768859\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <strong>COMANOMALY is still in active development</strong>. As such, many aspects of the demo are not final and may change in the future. If you find a bug, or if there are parts of the game you don’t enjoy, please let us know so we can improve its quality. 🙏🏻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TL;DR: Game is still in development; suggestions are very welcome.</strong> ⚠️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/058de2903351d46608022c6834e85233.webp?t=1771768859\" width=400 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/e19f3c95deffd95c9f7f329915ebacad.poster.avif?t=1771768859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921560/extras/e19f3c95deffd95c9f7f329915ebacad.webm?t=1771768859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta